<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mattel said cut, Hasbro said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mattel said cut, Hasbro said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Mattel Inc to neutral from outperform and upgraded Hasbro Inc to outperform from neutral, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Hasbro shares rose 1/8 to 37-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Mattel shares were not yet open for trading on the NYSE. Shares closed at 27-5/8.</p>
</text>
